CI (py3.11) failed the shrink-only ratchet on `unused-ignore: 0 -> 1` while
the same tree was clean locally (py3.12). PyYAML annotates `dispose` on some
interpreter/stub combinations and not others, so a `type: ignore[no-untyped-call]`
on that call is USED on one and UNUSED on the other -- and the ratchet trips on
whichever you did not run. Binding the loader as `Any` asks mypy nothing on
either, so the suppression disappears rather than moving.

